1
00:05:25,263 --> 00:05:31,263
Killers for hire are paid for what they can do, not
for what they believe... until today.

2
00:10:50,526 --> 00:10:56,526
Men of War is a action, drama, thriller film directed by Perry Lang.

3
00:16:15,789 --> 00:16:21,789
Nick Gunar is a burnt-out, jaded and hard-up former mercenary who is
having a difficult time adjusting to civilian life.

4
00:21:41,052 --> 00:21:47,052
At the end of his rope, he is hired by the Nitro Mine Corporation to strong-arm the natives of a
South China Sea island into giving up their rights to its valuable mineral resources.

5
00:27:06,315 --> 00:27:12,315
Nick loathes the thought of another mission, but this seemingly easy job will
earn him enough money to get back with his estranged family.

6
00:32:31,578 --> 00:32:37,578
He recruits some of his former mercenary buddies to help him with the job.

7
00:37:56,842 --> 00:38:02,842
The island people refuse to give up their land and Nick decides to
help them fight the greedy corporation that hired him.

8
00:43:22,105 --> 00:43:28,105
As greed and treachery begin to unravel, Nick's
band of mercenaries choose sides.

9
00:48:47,368 --> 00:48:53,368
Nick Gunar, played by Dolph Lundgren.

10
00:54:12,631 --> 00:54:18,631
Loki, played by Charlotte Lewis.

11
00:59:37,894 --> 00:59:43,894
Po, played by BD Wong.

12
01:05:03,157 --> 01:05:09,157
Ocker, played by Tim Guinee.

13
01:10:28,421 --> 01:10:34,421
Grace Lashield, played by Catherine Bell.

14
01:15:53,684 --> 01:15:59,684
Keefer, played by Trevor Goddard.

15
01:21:18,947 --> 01:21:24,947
Men of War is a 1994 action film directed by Perry Lang, written by
John Sayles, and revised by Ethan Reiff and Cyrus Voris.

16
01:26:44,210 --> 01:26:50,210
It stars Dolph Lundgren as Nick Gunar, a former Special Ops soldier who leads a
group of mercenaries to a treasure island in the South China Sea.

17
01:32:09,473 --> 01:32:15,473
The film explores themes of island, martial arts, showdown, asia, village.

18
01:37:34,736 --> 01:37:40,736
The tone is emotional and intense.
